                Posted on October 14, 2026 
            </span>
                <ul class="nav align-items-center grid gap-2 ms-auto mb-0 p-0">
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a aria-label="Share to Facebook" href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3a%2f%2fwww.northreadingma.gov%2fm%2fnewsflash%2fHome%2fDetail%2f148" class="p-1 text-white d-flex">
